From: mscharged-port
Subject: Admit the original online ranking overlay
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84
Classification: temporary explicit original-source diagnostic admission

After each game of an online ranked series, PausePostGameScene pushes
OVERLAY_ONLINE_RANKING (93), the results and points overlay whose
countdown continues the series. 0740 admitted the online scenes but not
this overlay, so under MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_ONLINE the first
game's results stopped the sequence diagnostic at the factory's
"unqualified original scene factory case".

The factory now admits OnlineRankingOverlay for the online diagnostic;
its source unit is compiled with the other online scenes.

diff --git a/src/Game/FE/BaseGameSceneManager.cpp b/src/Game/FE/BaseGameSceneManager.cpp
index 26dedd7..f3de1f5 100644
--- a/src/Game/FE/BaseGameSceneManager.cpp
+++ b/src/Game/FE/BaseGameSceneManager.cpp
@@ -637,7 +637,7 @@ BaseSceneHandler* BaseGameSceneManager::Push(SceneList newscene, ScreenMovement
         newHandler = new (nlMalloc(sizeof(PausePostGameScene), 8, false)) PausePostGameScene(PausePostGameScene::MODE_STATISTICS);
         break;
 #endif
-#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE)
+#if !defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_SEQUENCE) || (defined(MSCHARGED_NATIVE) && defined(MSCHARGED_DIAGNOSTIC_FRONTEND_ONLINE))
     case (SceneList)93:
         newHandler = new (nlMalloc(sizeof(OnlineRankingOverlay), 8, false)) OnlineRankingOverlay();
         break;
